#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:5
msgid "Create new title block"
msgstr "创建新图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:7
msgid ""
"Creating new title block from cero is not allowed, one template can only be "
"created starting from an other. If no template is selected, the default "
"title block from `QET collection`_ is the base to create a new title block."
msgstr ""
"不允许从 cero 创建新的图框，一个模板只能从另一个开始创建。 如果没有选择模板，来自 `QET collection <QET "
"collection_>`_ 的默认图框是创建新图框的基础 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech default title block"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 默认图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:17
msgid "Create title block from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏创建图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:19
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Project properties > New folio** menu item to display "
"`default folio properties`_ from `project`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 **项目 > 项目属性 > 新建 folio** 菜单项以显示 `默认 volio 属性 <default folio "
"properties_>`_ from `项目 <project_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:20
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:39
msgid ""
"Go to `title block information`_ and select the base title block that should"
" be used to create the new one."
msgstr "转到 `图框信息 <title block information_>`_ 并选择用于创建新标题的基础图框 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:21
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:40
msgid "Select the option **Duplicate and edit this template**."
msgstr "选择选项 **复制并编辑本模板** 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:26
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:45
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech New folio properties PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 新立体属性 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:28
msgid ""
"Choose the name for the new title block template and press **OK** to create "
"it."
msgstr "选择新图框模板的名称并按 **OK** 创建它 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:33
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:53
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech New folio save PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech New Folio 保存 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:36
msgid "Create title block from folio properties"
msgstr "从 folio 属性创建图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:38
msgid ""
"`Display folio properties`_ from one of the `folios`_ of the `project`_."
msgstr ""
"`Display follio属性 <Display folio properties_>`_，来自 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中的 `项目 "
"<project_>`_ 之一。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:47
msgid "Edit the template and save it."
msgstr "编辑模板并保存。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:48
msgid ""
"Choose the parent collection and the name from the new title block template,"
" then press **OK** to create it."
msgstr "从新图框模板中选择父收藏和名称，然后按 **OK** 创建它 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:56
msgid "Create title block from project panel"
msgstr "从项目面板创建图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:58
msgid ""
"Right click on the `user title blocks collection`_ from `project panel`_."
msgstr ""
"右键点击 `用户图框集 <user title blocks collection_>`_ 从 `项目面板 <project panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:59
msgid ""
"Click the option **New template** to add a new title block with the default "
"template from `QET collection`_ as base."
msgstr "点击选项 **新模板** 添加一个新的图框，其中以 `QET收藏 <QET collection_>`_ 的默认模板作为基础。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:64
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech项目面板"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_new.rst:68
msgid ""
"If the `project panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**."
msgstr "如果 `项目面板 <project panel_>`_ 没有显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 项目** 显示。"
